Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Worked example: Contoso's Elevate policy, machine-wide (HKLM). See README.md in
; enterprise/example/ for what it pins. Import with `reg import example.reg` from an
; elevated prompt, or apply the same values through the ADMX template in a GPO.
;
; The same values under HKEY_CURRENT_USER\SOFTWARE\Policies\Reothor\Elevate apply to one
; user; where both exist, the machine value wins.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Reothor\Elevate]
"ClientId"="11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555"
"DisableUpdateCheck"=dword:00000001
"ManagedProfilesUrl"="https://example.com/elevate/profiles.json"
